        'fincal.ev.hra1.desc':    'If you claim HRA, collect rent receipts from your landlord for Apr–Sep. Keep rent agreement handy. Landlord PAN required if rent > ₹1L/year.',
        'fincal.ev.hra2.title':   '📑 HRA Claim — Collect Rent Receipts (Oct–Mar)',
        'fincal.ev.hra2.desc':    'Collect rent receipts for Oct–Mar. Submit to employer before February to ensure TDS is adjusted.',
        'fincal.ev.invdecl.title':'📊 Investment Declarations to Employer (Jan 31)',
        'fincal.ev.invdecl.desc': 'Submit final investment proof to your employer for TDS calculation. Include all 80C investments, HRA proofs, home loan certificate.',
