        'fincal.ev.crrep.title':  '🔒 Free Annual Credit Report Check',
        'fincal.ev.crrep.desc':   'Check your free CIBIL report at cibil.com (1 free per year per bureau). Also check Experian, Equifax. Errors corrected = instant score boost.',
        'fincal.edu.adv.title':   '💸 Advance Tax: Cost of Missing',
        'fincal.edu.adv.desc':    'Miss an advance tax instalment? You owe <strong>1% interest per month</strong> under Sec 234B/234C. On ₹1L tax liability, that\'s ₹12,000 extra per year — for no reason. Pay quarterly: Jun 15, Sep 15, Dec 15, Mar 15.',
        'fincal.edu.itr.title':   '📋 ITR: Beyond the Deadline',
        'fincal.edu.itr.desc':    'Miss Jul 31? You can file a belated return by Dec 31, but you\'ll pay <strong>₹1,000–₹5,000 late fee</strong> (₹5,000 if income above ₹5L) + 1% interest/month on unpaid tax. Losses also <strong>cannot be carried forward</strong>.',
        'fincal.edu.ppf.title':   '🏛️ PPF: The April Rule',
