        'coffeecan.succeed.title':           '✅ Why the Strategy Still Makes Sense',
        'coffeecan.verdict':                 '<strong>The honest verdict:</strong> Coffee Can investing works at the portfolio level, not the individual stock level. Use this screener to build a diversified basket of 10–15 names, re-screen annually, and accept that roughly 3 in 10 picks will disappoint. The strategy\'s edge is the <em>remaining 7</em> compounding undisturbed — not stock-picking perfection.',
        'coffeecan.disclaimer.full':         '⚠ <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This screener is for educational purposes only. All data is manually curated from publicly available annual reports and is approximate. This is not SEBI-registered investment advice. Past performance of companies does not guarantee future returns. Please consult a registered financial advisor before investing.',
